        <mxCell id="inspect" value="第三方独立检查最终有效前缀&#10;带 XSID 仍检查；检查与采用分开&#10;候选须通过严格复核与交互锚点约束" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=none;html=0;fillColor=#fff7ed;strokeColor=#fdba74;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Helvetica,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif;fontSize=19;fontColor=#9a3412;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
