        <mxCell id="note" value="缓存组只用于出站亲和：不改变真实会话、账号选择、reasoning replay 或 WS 归属。&#10;稳定身份不会因前缀失败自动换号；上游实际缓存收益仍需独立实验。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=none;html=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Helvetica,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif;fontSize=20;fontColor=#475569;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
